# Auriok Salvagers: "{1}{W}: Return target artifact card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to your hand."
# The limits, each refused while the card sits in a graveyard where the other qualities hold:
#   - mana value 2 (Mind Stone, sacrificed on turn 3) - the boundary is "1 or less";
#   - not an artifact (Lightning Bolt, cast on turn 5), mana value 1;
#   - not your graveyard (Bot2's Black Lotus, mana value 0), the same name as the one Bot1 owns.
# Turn 2: Bot2 casts Duress off its own Black Lotus and takes Sol Ring from Bot1's hand, putting a mana value 1
# artifact card in Bot1's graveyard. The positive control, on turn 5: that Sol Ring comes back to hand.

